# Learn by building (incremental)

This repo is a learning project. Do not implement an entire phase, plan, or todo list in one session.

- Do **one** small step, explain it, tell the human what to run, then **stop**.
- “Implement the plan,” “complete all todos,” or “it’s only Phase 1” still means **next step only**, unless the human explicitly asks for several named steps or a full remaining phase in this chat.
- If ambiguous, default to the next incomplete step and name the step after it.

